ts³11100670183³1version³13³1cache_oldmajor³16³1cache_oldauthor³16³1cache_diff_default_author³11³1revision³17³1text_default³1ip³2205.231.31.86³2ts³21100670183³2version³21³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3*³3text³3'''4 Peaks Technology Group, Inc., Your Software & IT Resource'''

At 4 Peaks Technology Group, our number one goal is to satisfy you the customer. We will do anything and everything it takes to make sure you are happy with our work. No job is too menial or too large. 

If you don't see something here that fits exactly what you are looking for, contact us and let us discuss your particular circumstances.

4 Peaks Technology Group can:

* Organize and operate a complete development project - just give us a concept and we'll see it through to completion and beyond.
* Participate in and augment an ongoing development effort to meet the "hump" when it comes - piece-meal work, additional programming or test resources.
* Transition from an existing team to get the project back on track - the worse off the project, the more we like it.
* Expert consulting - our subject matter specialists will help ensure your success.
* Training - we can train your people in our processes and subject matter expertise.

4 Peaks Technology Group is now making webhosting truly affordable. Visit our webhosting service at http://BetterThanYours.com. Comprehensive hosting services starting at only $14.95 per year.

For further information contact info@4peakstech.com or visit our website at http://4PeaksTech.com

--------------------
 -- Michael Kielsky
 4 Peaks Technology Group, Inc.
 http://4peakstech.com
 http://betterthanyours.com
